### Quick checklist before running the code

| ✅ | Item |
|---|------|
| ✅ | Make sure `breakNode` is the exact node you want to modify (or replace it with your own node). |
| ✅ | Verify that the node is indeed a `BreakStatement` (or whatever type your AST uses). |
| ✅ | After calling `updateBreak`, inspect the returned value or the modified AST to confirm the change. |

If you run into any issues—like the node not being found, or the label still not updating—double‑check that the node you’re passing is the same instance that appears in your AST. Feel free to paste the node’s JSON here if you’d like me to take a closer look!
